{
  "kind": "mutation",
  "id": "mut-format-mismatch-native-html-adm",
  "title": "Native-only impression is filled with plain banner HTML instead of a Native JSON payload",
  "format": "native",
  "protocol": "ortb-2.6",
  "context": "web",
  "dialect": "iab",
  "scenario": "pair",
  "tags": ["mutation", "format-mismatch"],
  "base": "bn-native-26-editorial-bare",
  "category": "format-mismatch",
  "specRef": "https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/Native-Ads/blob/dd45d0733d96710981541ea213f4452952f41c40/OpenRTB-Native-Ads-Specification-Final-1.2.md#6-1",
  "patch": {
    "response": [
      {
        "op": "replace",
        "path": "/seatbid/0/bid/0/adm",
        "value": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></head><body><div style=\"width:600px;height:315px;background:#223b62\">NOT A NATIVE JSON PAYLOAD</div></body></html>"
      },
      {
        "op": "remove",
        "path": "/seatbid/0/bid/0/mtype"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expect": {
    "request": {
      "maxLevel": "warning"
    },
    "response": {
      "maxLevel": "warning"
    },
    "crosscheck": {
      "must": [
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.id_match",
          "path": "id",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.impid_resolved",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].impid",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.above_floor",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].price",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.native_invalid_adm",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm",
          "level": "warn"
        }
      ],
      "mustNot": [
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.native_complete",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.native_missing_assets",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm"
        }
      ]
    },
    "http": {
      "status": 200
    },
    "browser": {
      "state": "success"
    }
  },
  "knownGap": null,
  "specNotes": [
    "This case demonstrates a format-mismatch check that already works: nativeAssetCrosscheck (gated on imp.native && bid.adm) tries to parse bid.adm as the Native 1.2 JSON/base64 asset payload; plain HTML is neither, so tryParseNativePayload throws and crosscheck.bid.native_invalid_adm (WARN) fires.",
    "bid.mtype is removed because the base fixture sets mtype:4 (native) to describe the correct native fill; keeping it on an HTML payload would conflate this content-type case with the separate, unvalidated bid.mtype question covered by DEF-195."
  ]
}
